<title>AUSTRALIA: Campbell Bros yr net jumps to A$7.44 mln.</title>
<headline>Campbell Bros yr net jumps to A$7.44 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    11.64 vs   8.00</p>
<p>    Net					7.44 vs   4.31</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     13   vs     12</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     21   vs     19</p>
<p>    Sales				  137.60 vs 113.37</p>
<p>    Other income			   1.28 vs   3.36</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   32.08 vs  22.27</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs loss 1.04</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked  </p>
<p>Pay date July 1</p>
<p>Reg date June 2</p>
<p>    Tax					4.20 vs   2.61</p>
<p>    Interest				 1.61 vs   1.51</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.62 vs   4.39</p>
<p>NOTE: Campbell Brothers Ltd is an industrial products and services provider. Campbell also announced a one for four share issue at A$3.60 a share to raise about A$21 million and a 10 cent per share fully franked special dividend.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
